message: "If you use this research code, please cite the archived v1.0.0 software release: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23641281."
title: "Building Energy Conditional Flow Matching: Six-Cohort Reliability Study"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23641281"
authors:
  - given-names: "Md. Mahbubur"
    family-names: "Rahman"
    affiliation: "Department of Mechatronics Engineering, Rajshahi University of Engineering & Technology (RUET), Rajshahi, Bangladesh"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0252-9140"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mahbubur2008018/building-energy-cfm-reliability"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Historical Python source code, protocol records and verified aggregate evidence for a six-cohort
  study of direct and residual conditional flow matching for building-energy estimation under
  distribution shifts, including frozen Drammen building holdout and Oslo school transfer.
keywords:
  - building energy estimation
  - conditional flow matching
  - probabilistic regression
  - distribution shift
  - model reliability
  - CatBoost
  - NGBoost
